==Trivia==
*"OutCats" is a pun on ''outcasts''.
*Sick Cat shares its name with [[Adult Cat (Rare Cat)|Adult Cat]]'s Evolved Form.
*Sick Cat is the only OutCat to have not won in any version. [[Trash Cat (Special Cat)|Trash Cat]] won in the [[The Battle Cats|English]] and Taiwanese Versions, while [[Stealth Cat (Special Cat)|Stealth Cat]] won in the Korean Version.
*[[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] is the only mobile version of the game to have not received The OutCats campaign.